candidate_text:
Position: Chief Product Owner (FinTech/Blockchain)
Moreinfo: I have over 8 years of experience in product development holding the Product Owner position combined with my past experience in marketing. Most of the products I developed were in Blockchain and FinTech industries and based in European, American, and Asian markets. My experience in startups and IT companies has taught me how to work in a dynamic market, build a product strategy, keep product-fit on a market, collaborate with stakeholders, manage development teams with over 30 people.  

Expertise and work experience in the following areas:
- Product strategy;
- Product developing (SDLC);
- Business goals identification;
- Forming and forecasting P&L indicators;
- Marketing strategy implementation from a product development view;
- Maintain roadmap and backlog;
- Be a connecting point for all teams on a product  development lifecycle (Proxy Product Manager);
- Marketing and Development teams management (over 30 ppl);
- Business requirements preparation (BRDs); 
- Product requirements preparation (PRDs) including acceptance criteria;
- UX wireframing;
- Business Development and presentations;
- Managing user flows for crypto exchanges, payment services, and blockchain-related products;
- Using Agile methodology (JIRA/Confluence/TFS);
- Market research and analysis.

Experience in managing solutions development for crypto exchanges, payment services, blockchain-based products including requirements for the main stock functions, payment processes (Visa, MC, payment processors), marketing indicators, compliance and AML solutions. Managing the implementation of payment cards, margin trading, mobile app (iOS and Android), and other functions on a cryptocurrency exchange, crypto wallets, staking providers, and game development. 

Raised the customer-facing product lines, some of which have become the core of today’s business.
Looking For: Fast growing market;
Product development;
Blockchain and FinTech markets are preferable.

I'm looking for company working on new/fast growing market and looking to become a market leader.
Highlights: Worked with a crypto exchange from CMC Top 50 with over 1M users;
Prepared product development strategy with the final presentation at Disrupt TechCrunch 2018 in San Francisco;
Product development that attracted $5 million investment;
Developing a product for a worldwide market with over 100K daily users.
English Level: fluent
Experience Years: 9.0
