Position: CTO FinTech, Crypto, Consumer Finance, Investments
Moreinfo: I am a CTO / R&D professional with over 20 years of commercial experience in FinTech. It includes working for banks, global digital lending companies, software development companies and digital media agencies.

During the last 12 years I have been building multi-functional and strong well-organised teams of professionals for delivering Global Consumer Finance products (loans), Investments platforms and Peer-to-peer platforms. Strong focus on mobile development in order to deliver perfect UI/UX for end users.

For the last 4 years I have been deeply involved in the development of blockchain and crypto related products: Crypto-backed loans, Crypto Trading, Earning account.
Highlights: - Global expansion for FinTech projects to EU and international markets;
- Built a mobile bank and went to Production;
- Built several P2P Lending platforms (Mintos.com, Lendermarket.com, P2P platform related to crypto lending)
- Built trading products for Asian markets;
