candidate_text:
Position: Agile project manager / Delivery manager / Scrum Master
Moreinfo: Overall more than 10 years of experience in software development, Agile project and product management and delivery. Hands-on experience with all Agile frameworks, product methodologies and team leadership and facilitation. 

I am capable to establish transparent and robust software development process with an emphasis on CI/CD, tests automation and teams cross-functionality. Capable to handle simultaneously multiple projects with distributed, multinational teams and clients. Comprehensive understanding of Agile frameworks, their pros and cons. 

Solid knowledge and experience in different business verticals, such as: eCommerce, Automotive, Embedded, Finance, Banking and Accounting, Insurance. 

My area of expertise are:
- Project scope evaluation and planning;
- Project budgeting;
- Software process and workflows;
- Managing project risks;
- Establishing and tracking project metrics;
- Product discovery;
- Project requirements collection and analysis;
- User stories creation and mapping;
- Stakeholders management;
- Facilitating project meetings;
- People management;
- Teams recruiting and building;
Looking For: I am looking for full-time job as Agile Project Manager,  Scrum Master or Product Manager in an ambitious and challenging project with top-notch technologies.
Highlights: As a Software development manager, I successfully delivered a bunch of projects which added significant business value to the eCommerce platform and also closed some long-lasting technical debts, e.g. the facets management feature across the platform, integration with an affiliate platform, a brand-new API for the Checkout component, platform migration to the new major version of the run time environment, and others.

As a Scrum master, I helped a team successfully deliver a product navigation and discovery component in a big eCommerce project. As a component, React SPA was developed and integrated with a Hybris SAP platform, Bloomreach search engine, Hippo CMS, PowerReview and other 3rd parties solutions. I facilitated team's empowerment, development of its strong morale and established transparent and robust Scrum process within development. Implementation of this project helped our client to boost his online presence from less than 1% to 10% and trigger increased amount of online sales - from less than 100 transactions per day to more than 1000 transactions.

As a Project manager, I managed to deliver multiple projects in the enterprise line of business (Finance, Banking and Insurance) with respect to time, budget and quality criteria. Project breakdown structure were designed, budget, quality, deliverables, and other details were agreed upon with customers.

As a local Product owner of IVI navigation map in the automotive industry, I was able to hit a start of production (deadline) on different global markets (EU, North America, China) for one of the main components in IVI domain. A bunch of complex interfaces between different IVI components have been agreed, dozens of ping-pong bugs which hadn't been fixed due to misunderstanding between parties, have been agreed with stackeholders to push to the next start of production and fixed later on, in the upcoming releases. It helped our client - one of the biggest Tier1 suppliers in the automotive industry, did not break commitments to ship IVI system to BMW car manufacturer.

My knowledge and skills are complemented by certificates: 
- Kanban Coaching Professional (KCP); 
- Kanban Management Professional (KMP);
- Agile Project and Delivery Management (ICP-APM);
- Professional Scrum master PSM1;
- ISTQB Test manager CTAL-TM;
English Level: upper
Experience Years: 11.0
